  "details": "It becomes tiresome to have to keep grabbing and dragging the viewfinder around as I walk around my track space. It would be great to be able to lock it to my body or head so that I can see what my camera sees at all times, especially while streaming. I'm imagining it looking similar to the 'face mirror' except it's the viewfinder instead\n\nCurrently the viewfinder only follows locomotion, so what I'm talking about is the real life walking around my room while in VR",
